{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "1788182026000-7a2715", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "打印纸和硒鼓怎么申领？每月什么时候统一采购？", "id": "88c86a9911f84b9cb22fb5f26e13c348", "created_at": "2026-08-31T13:13:46", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "d4d4f5ca99f341d8a88cb2f9aa4df262", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-08-31T13:13:46", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "b5659055032843c18a6069336a2da1ed", "created_at": "2026-08-31T13:13:54", "finished_at": "2026-08-31T13:14:26"}, {"type": "text", "text": "每月 **25 日前** 在 OA 提交「办公用品申领单」，行政 26–28 日统一采购、次月 1 日发放。\n硒鼓属耐用品，需以旧换新（旧件交回行政登记）；打印纸按部门定额：文职岗 2 箱/月，超定额需部门经理审批。", "id": "44764ed67b434eb7b49eb51937952e89", "created_at": "2026-08-31T13:13:54", "finished_at": "2026-08-31T13:14:26"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "82bfd35fddfd4e19ba1b4640452028d3", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-08-31T13:13:54", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-08-31T13:14:26", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "急用的话能单独买吗？", "id": "a94c603a3ef643278587e48c872fe306", "created_at": "2026-08-31T13:19:46", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "7713911c2bd94bd7bc071720a4edeeb4", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-08-31T13:19:46", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "c68b885129c54398815cba1a18e42198", "created_at": "2026-08-31T13:19:54", "finished_at": "2026-08-31T13:20:26"}, {"type": "text", "text": "可以。500 元以内先在企微找行政报备、当日采购（走备用金）；超 500 元需走紧急审批（部门经理+行政）。月末统一补录 OA，别走账外。", "id": "7ff7b224f93b474ab50de7497ef4cdba", "created_at": "2026-08-31T13:19:54", "finished_at": "2026-08-31T13:20:26"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "cc7d2a61f26745abb819866d66bcea87", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-08-31T13:19:54", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-08-31T13:20:26", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "硒鼓旧件回收有补贴吗？", "id": "f60041e0749549ab9d5c2f47788aa3e2", "created_at": "2026-08-31T13:21:26", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "bdac1380fee54af4a4bc63e113ba62bc", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-08-31T13:21:26", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "f3acf7082aab450c9b9e6d49ee1c2fae", "created_at": "2026-08-31T13:21:32", "finished_at": "2026-08-31T13:22:11"}, {"type": "text", "text": "有，原厂回收每只抵 20–30 元（计入下次采购款），行政按季度集中寄回；杂牌兼容硒鼓不参与回收，但单价低 40%，打印量小的部门可用兼容款。", "id": "d4bd4ed00fb942d09ce0cdfa768897d0", "created_at": "2026-08-31T13:21:32", "finished_at": "2026-08-31T13:22:11"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "bf094634ae1142ec96789d2bd2a53af0", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-08-31T13:21:32", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-08-31T13:22:11", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}], "reply_context": {}, "permission_context": {}, "tool_context": {}, "tasks_context": {}, "middle_context": {}}}}